{% if gql_fabric is none or gql_cc is none %}
> ⚠️ **Data source unavailable.** This section needs the device intent (GraphQL) and the AVD config contexts (GraphQL).
{% else -%}
{% set devices = ((gql_fabric.devices if gql_fabric else []) or []) | sort(attribute='name') %}
{% set ccs = ((gql_cc.config_contexts if gql_cc else []) or []) %}
{% set ns = namespace(intent_shared=0, intent_local=0, config=0, backed=0, rows=[]) %}
{% for c in ccs %}{% set ns.intent_shared = ns.intent_shared + ((c.data | tojson(indent=2)).splitlines() | length) %}{% endfor %}
{% set gcs = (gc.filter(device__tags__name='avd').select_related('device') | list) if gc is not none else [] %}
{% for d in devices -%}
{% set avd = (d.local_config_context_data or {}).get('avd', {}) %}
{% set local_lines = (avd | tojson(indent=2)).splitlines() | length if avd else 0 %}
{% set ns.intent_local = ns.intent_local + local_lines %}
{% set g = (gcs | selectattr('device.name', 'equalto', d.name) | list | first) %}
{% set cfg_lines = (g.backup_config.splitlines() | length) if g and g.backup_config else 0 %}
{% set ns.config = ns.config + cfg_lines %}
{% if g and g.backup_last_success_date %}{% set ns.backed = ns.backed + 1 %}{% endif %}
{% set _ = ns.rows.append({'name': d.name, 'role': d.role.name if d.role else '', 'local': local_lines, 'cfg': cfg_lines, 'backup': g.backup_last_success_date if g else None}) %}
{%- endfor %}
{% set intent = ns.intent_shared + ns.intent_local %}
{% set amp = (ns.config / intent) | round(1) if intent else 0 %}
{#- Measured figures published by the Import Validation Results job onto the fabric Location: intent lines are the
    AVD inputs rendered from Nautobot, configuration lines are the intended configurations AVD built from them. -#}
{% set cfns = namespace(cf={}) %}
{% for d in devices %}{% set lcf = (d.location or {}).get('_custom_field_data') or {} %}{% if lcf.get('intent_lines') and not cfns.cf %}{% set cfns.cf = lcf %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set cf_intent = cfns.cf.get('intent_lines') %}{% set cf_config = cfns.cf.get('config_lines') %}
{% set cf_amp = cfns.cf.get('amplification') or (((cf_config / cf_intent) | round(0) | int) ~ 'x' if cf_intent and cf_config else none) %}
{% if cf_intent and cf_config -%}
Intent for this fabric is **{{ cf_intent }} lines**: the AVD inputs rendered from Nautobot, the shared AVD settings plus each device's node facts. AVD builds that intent into **{{ cf_config }} lines** of intended EOS configuration for the **{{ devices | length }} device{{ 's' if devices | length != 1 }}**{% if cf_amp %}, a **{{ cf_amp }}** amplification{% endif %}. Both figures are measured by the Import Validation Results job when it renders the fabric.

| | | | | |
|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| **{{ cf_intent }}** | → | **{{ cf_config }}** | = | **{{ cf_amp or '-' }}** |
| lines of intent | | lines of configuration | | ratio (configuration ÷ intent) |
{% elif ns.config == 0 -%}
Intent for this fabric is **{{ intent }} lines** of structured data in Nautobot ({{ ns.intent_shared }} shared AVD settings + {{ ns.intent_local }} per-device facts), but the rendered-configuration side has not been measured: the Import Validation Results job has not published line counts for this fabric{% if gc is not none %} and **no configuration backup** exists yet for the {{ devices | length }} device{{ 's' if devices | length != 1 }}{% endif %}. Run the Import Validation Results job{% if gc is not none %}, or the Golden Configuration backup job{% endif %}.
{% else -%}
Intent for this fabric is **{{ intent }} lines** of structured data in Nautobot: **{{ ns.intent_shared }}** lines of shared AVD settings (the two AVD config contexts) plus **{{ ns.intent_local }}** lines of per-device facts. That intent is rendered into **{{ ns.config }} lines** of EOS configuration across the **{{ devices | length }} device{{ 's' if devices | length != 1 }}** (as last backed up by Golden Configuration), a **{{ amp }}x** amplification.

| | | | | |
|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| **{{ intent }}** | → | **{{ ns.config }}** | = | **{{ amp }}x** |
| lines of intent | | lines of configuration | | ratio (configuration ÷ intent) |
{% endif %}

{% set latest = results.filter(post__device__tags__name='avd', date__gte=reporting_period_start_date, pre__isnull=False).order_by('-date').first() if results is not none else none %}
{% set post_time = latest.post.snapshot.created if latest else none %}
{% set fresh = ns.rows | selectattr('backup') | selectattr('backup', 'gt', post_time) | list | length if post_time else 0 %}
{% if cf_intent and cf_config -%}
{% if ns.intent_local -%}
The Nautobot side of that ratio is visible per device below: **{{ ns.intent_shared }} lines** of shared AVD settings apply to the whole fabric and **{{ ns.intent_local }} lines** are per-device facts.
{%- else -%}
**{{ ns.intent_shared }} lines** of that intent are the shared AVD settings that apply to the whole fabric; the rest is built per device from the source of truth.
